#: package.description
msgid ""
"AssumptionsLab evaluates the statistical assumptions required for common "
"analytical techniques and pairs every diagnostic with evidence-based "
"methodological guidance, interpretation, and educational support, rather "
"than reporting isolated test statistics. It covers group comparisons "
"(independent and related samples, ANOVA/ANCOVA), regression (linear, "
"logistic, ordinal logistic, multinomial logistic), path analysis and "
"structural validation, and time series, alongside a built-in methodological "
"library and a unified, APA-7th-referenced bibliography."
msgstr ""

